            "_type": "span",
            "_key": "a1s",
            "text": "Jade Bracke photographs people, objects and rooms for brands, hotels, studios and magazines. She travels for commissions.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "_key": "a2",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "_key": "a2s",
            "text": "The work is quiet on purpose: available light where possible, one camera, and enough time in the room to stop noticing it. Commissions usually run from a day to a week, with a small crew or none.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_type": "block",
        "_key": "a3",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_type": "span",
            "_key": "a3s",
            "text": "Prints are made to order from the original files. Enquiries about editorial, hospitality and interior commissions are welcome by email.",
